Description: avcodec/qsv: submit frame packing payloads and propagate callback errors
 .
 Append frame packing through mfxEncodeCtrl payloads and expose a default-on
 frame_packing option. Propagate set_encode_ctrl_cb failures to the caller.
 For HEVC, inspect the SDK's VPS and SPS and refuse marked frames if their
 non-packed constraints cannot be established as clear; the SDK interface
 has no general constraint switch here. Name the packing and opt-out in
 every unsupported-layout diagnostic.
 .
 Compiled with oneVPL 2.17; the unsupported HEVC packing guard is exercised.
 No Intel encoder hardware was available for an encoded-stream proof.
 .
 Assisted-by: gpt-6-astra via Codex
